**Before routing, database, or deployment work:** Read `MASTER_KNOWLEDGE_DOCUMENT.md` at repo root. It is in the repo for AI access; it must never be served on the website.

That document is the single source of truth. It contains:
- **HARD STOPS** (routing frozen, no schema without approval, no `is_brand_builder` changes, no new Supabase client, no secrets in docs, etc.)
- Supabase config (project ref, env var names, pagination/timeout rules)
- URL rules (www only, 5-segment neighborhood pattern)
- CRM leads system, enrichment API, Cloudflare Worker notes
- Deprecated services (no Perplexity, Gemini, Resend, Pipedrive admin UI removed)
- Command format (exact copy/paste, no placeholders)
- Verification: test before claiming done; 5-page test after changes

**When Robert says "update":** Run `npm run update` or fetch from private repo, merge session takeaways, write new version to private repo. Never to list-wise-boost.

**When Robert says "takeaways":** Generate structured text for project memory. Output format:
- Key Outcomes (what was done, not how)
- Config / Infrastructure Changes
- Deprecated or New Patterns
- Version Bump Notes

No full chats, deployment nitty-gritty, or brainstorming. Only outcomes. Run `npm run takeaways` for template. Robert will have Claude compile daily reports and incorporate into this rule file.

**Cron:** A job runs daily at 20:00 MST to create a report slot in `daily_takeaways` table. Sync to `docs/cursor-daily-updates.md` with `npm run takeaways:sync`. Claude compiles into project-knowledge.mdc and private repo (never list-wise-boost).

**When Robert says "ryt":** Update **only** the master knowledge document (`MASTER_KNOWLEDGE_DOCUMENT.md` at repo root). Read it, integrate session knowledge, write back. Commit and push to staging. (Takeaways is separate: daily updates/learnings from each AI for the day.)
